{"id": "19-1958-2-10", "zh": "73. labh 之后的 iṃ、ī 可变为 thaṃ、thā", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1959-2-10", "zh": "在 labh 之后，iṃ 和 ī 可选地变为 thaṃ 和 thā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1959-11-21", "zh": "如：so alabhittha、labhittha、alabhi、labhi；以 iṃ 为词缀时，有 alatthaṃ、alabhiṃ 等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1960-2-10", "zh": "26. labh、vas、chid、bhid、rud 以 cchaṅa 替代", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1961-2-7", "zh": "labh 等词根连同 ssa 一起变为 cchaṅa。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1961-8-14", "zh": "如 lacchati、labhissati，lacchanti、labhissanti 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1961-15-21", "zh": "在条件式中，ssā 部分以 cchaṅa 替代，得 alacchā、alabhissa 等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1961-22-28", "zh": "vas 表示居住：vacchati、vasissati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1961-29-43", "zh": "被动语态中，依据“多样性”规则的支配，按“assū”规则取 u 音，再经前形同化，得 vussati、vussissati 等。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1961-44-47", "zh": "同样有 avacchā、avasissā。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1961-48-65", "zh": "chid 表示切成两半：checchati、chindissati；按“mañca rudhādīnaṃ”规则加 ṃ 增音，并加 la 中缀。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-1961-66-69", "zh": "并删除 la。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-1961-70-76", "zh": "bhid 表示破裂：bhecchati、bhindissati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1961-77-79", "zh": "abhecchā、abhindissā。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-1961-80-86", "zh": "rud 表示哭泣：rucchati、rodissati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1961-87-90", "zh": "arucchā、arodissā 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-1962-2-18", "zh": "在其他词缀前，chid 也依“cchaṅa”的规则分割而变为 cchaṅa：在过去时的 ūṃ 词缀前，得 acchecchuṃ、acchindiṃsu。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1962-19-28", "zh": "上述以外的其他词根也是这样，如 gam 表示行走：gacchaṃ、gacchissaṃ。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1962-29-72", "zh": "在其他词缀前也是如此，如 vac 表示清楚地说等。被动语态中，依据“多样性”规则的支配，即使后面跟的是 ti 等词尾，也视用例而定：按“vacādīnaṃ vassuṭa vā”规则，vac 等词根的 va 在被动语态中变为 uṭa，并按“assū”规则把 a 变为 u；因此有 dhammo uccati、vuccati，vuccanti 等；ya 也同化为前面的音。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "19-1963-2-8", "zh": "27. bhuj、muc、vac、vis 以 kkhaṅa 替代", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1964-2-7", "zh": "bhuj 等词根连同 ssa 一起变为 kkhaṅa。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1964-8-14", "zh": "如 vakkhati、vacissati，vakkhanti、vacissanti 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1965-2-5", "zh": "21. 在 ī 等词尾前，vac 加 oma", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1966-2-6", "zh": "在 ī 等词尾前，vac 加 oma。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1966-7-21", "zh": "因为带有 m 附加标记，按释则“mānubandho sarānamantā paro”，它置于元音之后。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-1966-22-28", "zh": "如 avoci、avocuṃ、avoco 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1966-29-33", "zh": "在过去时（非今日）中：avaca、avacā、vacā 等。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1966-34-40", "zh": "在条件式中：avakkhā、avacissā，avakkhiṃsu、avacissiṃsu 等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1966-41-43", "zh": "vaceyya 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-1966-44-46", "zh": "被动语态中：vucceyya 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1966-47-52", "zh": "同样有 vacatu、vuccatu 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1967-2-16", "zh": "bhuj 表示保护与吞食：按“bhujā”等规则以 kkha 替代，得 bhokkhati、bhuñjissati。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1968-2-17", "zh": "kus 表示辱骂，带前缀 ā，并把它变为短音；经过 la 中缀、删除与元音增强，应知有 akkosati 等。", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "19-1969-2-9", "zh": "34. kus、ruh 之后的 ī 变为 chi", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1970-2-10", "zh": "在 kus 和 ruh 之后，ī 可选地变为 chi。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1970-11-16", "zh": "经后形同化和换为第一字母，得 akkocchi、akkosi 等。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1970-17-25", "zh": "ruh 表示上升，带前缀 abhi：abhirucchi、abhiruhi 等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1971-2-9", "zh": "vah 表示到达：vahati、vahanti。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1971-10-31", "zh": "被动语态中加 kya，按“hassa vipallāso”规则进行换位，因此得 so vuyhati；按“assū”规则变为 u。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-1971-32-35", "zh": "vahissati、vuyhissati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-1971-36-41", "zh": "avahi、avuyhittha、avuhi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-1971-42-46", "zh": "avahissā、vuyhīssā 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-1971-47-50", "zh": "vaheyya、vuyheyya。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-1971-51-55", "zh": "vahatu、vuyhatu 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-1972-2-5", "zh": "jar 表示衰老，", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1973-2-9", "zh": "5,174. jar、mar 以 īyaṅa 替代", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1974-2-12", "zh": "在 māna、nta 和 ti 等词尾前，jar 和 mar 可选地变为 īyaṅa。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1974-13-14", "zh": "jīyati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-1974-15-29", "zh": "按“jara sadānamīma”规则加 īma 增音，并加 la 中缀，得 jīrati。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-1974-30-32", "zh": "被动语态中：jīrīyati、jīyīyati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1974-33-39", "zh": "同样有 jīyissati、jīrissati，jīyīyissati、jīrīyissati。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1974-40-45", "zh": "ajīyi、ajīri，ajīyīyi、ajīrīyi。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-1974-46-54", "zh": "ajīyissā、ajīrissā，ajīyīyissā、ajīrīyissā、ajīyissā、ajīrīyissā 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1974-55-67", "zh": "mar 表示舍弃生命，变为 īyaṅa：mīyati、marati，mīyanti、maranti 等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1975-2-5", "zh": "dis 表示观看，", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1976-2-12", "zh": "5,124. dis 以 passa、dassa、dasa、da、dakkha 替代", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1977-2-7", "zh": "这些替代形式可选地用于 dis。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-1977-8-10", "zh": "因为由多个字母构成，所以替代整个词根。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1977-11-16", "zh": "passati、passanti，dakkhati、dakkhanti。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-1977-17-26", "zh": "被动语态中加 kya，经前形同化，得 dissati、dissanti、vipassīyati、dakkhīyati 等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1978-2-13", "zh": "6,69. 在 dakkha、kha、hehi、hohi 之后删除", "confidence": 55}
{"id": "19-1979-2-9", "zh": "在 dakkha 等替代形式之后，ssa 可选地删除。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1979-10-12", "zh": "dakkhati、dakkhissati。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-1979-13-23", "zh": "apassi、passi，apassiṃsu、passiṃsu，apasso、passo，apassittha、passittha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-1979-24-29", "zh": "apassiṃ、passiṃ，apassimha、passimha。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-1979-30-37", "zh": "同样有 adassī、dassī，adassiṃsu、dassiṃsu 等。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-1979-38-43", "zh": "在过去时（非今日）中以 dasa 替代：addasā、addasa。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1979-44-47", "zh": "addā、adda 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-1979-48-51", "zh": "apassissa、dakkhissa 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-1979-52-58", "zh": "passeyya、dakkheyya，passatu、dakkhatu 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-1980-2-18", "zh": "sad 表示散开、行走、沉没和取用，带前缀 ni；按“jarasadānamīma vā”规则加 īma 增音。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-1980-19-23", "zh": "nisīdati、nisīdanti 等。", "confidence": 90}
{"id": "19-1980-24-27", "zh": "行为语态中：nisajjati、nisajjate。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-1981-2-10", "zh": "yaj 表示供养天神、结交与布施：yajati、yajanti 等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-1981-11-12", "zh": "被动语态中——", "confidence": 80}
